meta {
  name: List Carts
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/private/carts?page=1&pageSize=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 10
  ~sortBy: createdAt
  ~sortOrder: desc
  ~isLoggedIn: true
}

docs {
  Requires an ADMIN session (run Public/Auth/Login (Admin) first). Anonymous -> 401, USER -> 403.

  Paginated envelope: { data, page, pageSize, total }. `total` reflects any applied filter.

  Sorting (toggle sortBy/sortOrder): sortBy in [createdAt, lastModifiedAt]; sortOrder in [asc, desc] (default asc). A sortBy outside the list -> 400.

  Filtering (toggle any): isLoggedIn (bool). Unknown filter keys are ignored.
}
